{"data":{"status":true,"competition":{"id":1765223,"visibility":"public","theme_colour":"purple-dark_un","paid":0,"title":"AI Advertisement","festival_id":520823,"organization_id":1033711,"web_url":null,"start_date":"2026-10-02T00:00:00+05:30","end_date":"2026-10-22T17:00:00+05:30","location":null,"type":"competitions","public_url":"competitions\/ai-advertisement-ai-fiesta-2026-inderprastha-engineering-college-1765223","region":"offline","details":"<p><strong>AI Advertisement:<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>Create. Design. Pitch.<\/p>\n<p>AI Advertisement is an AI-powered creativity and advertising competition conducted as part of AI Fiesta 2026, an 8-hour offline AI challenge organized by THINK AI at Inderprastha Engineering College (IPEC), Ghaziabad.<\/p>\n<p>Participants will be given a product or concept and will use AI tools to create an advertisement and supporting presentation. They will then present their idea and pitch it to the judges.<\/p>\n<p><strong>What This Challenge Tests:<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>AI-powered creativity<\/li>\n<li>Product and visual design<\/li>\n<li>Marketing concepts<\/li>\n<li>Presentation and pitching<\/li>\n<li>Creative problem solving<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Format:<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>Participants will receive a product or concept from the organizers.<\/p>\n<p>Using permitted AI tools, participants must develop an advertisement and supporting presentation and present their concept to the judges.<\/p>\n<p>This is an individual participation competition.<\/p>\n<p>Participants must complete and submit their work within the prescribed challenge deadline.<\/p>\n<p><strong>Eligibility:<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>The competition is open to undergraduate engineering students interested in Artificial Intelligence, creativity, design, marketing, innovation, and presentation.<\/p>\n<p><strong>Event Details:<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Date: 22 October 2026<\/li>\n<li>Mode: Offline<\/li>\n<li>Venue: AIML Seminar Hall &amp; CSE Seminar Hall, Inderprastha Engineering College (IPEC), Ghaziabad<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Rules &amp; Guidelines:<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Participants must follow all instructions provided by the organizers.<\/li>\n<li>The advertisement and supporting presentation must be created during the designated challenge period.<\/li>\n<li>Participants must use only tools and resources permitted by the organizers.<\/li>\n<li>Participants must submit their work within the prescribed deadline.<\/li>\n<li>Plagiarism, impersonation, or any form of unfair practice may lead to disqualification.<\/li>\n<li>Participants must present their concept to the judges as instructed by the organizers.<\/li>\n<li>The organizers reserve the right to make decisions regarding participation, evaluation, and disqualification in accordance with the event rules.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Participation in AI Fiesta 2026:<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>AI Advertisement is one of the three competitions conducted as part of AI Fiesta 2026.<\/p>\n<p>Participants may participate in one, two, or all three AI Fiesta competitions:<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Built in 30<\/li>\n<li>Prompt to Wars<\/li>\n<li>AI Advertisement<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Winner Recognition:<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>The winner of AI Advertisement will receive a trophy and winner certificate.<\/p>\n<p>Eligible participants will also receive a participation certificate.<\/p>\n<p>AI Fiesta 2026 &mdash; Build it. Prompt it. Create it. Pitch it.<\/p>\n<p>Organized by THINK AI, Inderprastha Engineering College (IPEC), Ghaziabad.<\/p>","overall_prizes":"Winner receives a trophy and certificate; participation certificates are also provided.","regn_open":1,"regn_type":1,"regn_url":null,"regn_email":"","registration_clicks":0,"user_id":28297380,"moderation_status":1,"overall_leaderboard":0,"reject_reason":null,"display_date":null,"created_at":"2026-10-03T12:46:11+05:30","updated_at":"2026-10-04T18:39:41+05:30","communication_sent":null,"certificate_at":null,"remarks":null,"branding":0,"disable_auto_r